  "description": "Tag matrix into column FSingle (own copy of r-wire-blank, read-write): on a DAO table-type recordset, AddNew, Fields(\"ID\").Value = n, Fields(\"FSingle\").Value = each source Arg in turn, Update. Rows n: 1 empty, 2 null, 3 missing, 4 bool-true, 5 ui1-7, 6 i2-7, 7 i4-7, 8 r4-1.5, 9 r8-1.5, 10 cy-1.5, 11 date-1.5, 12 bstr-7, 13 bstr-abc, 14 bstr-empty, 15 bytes-07, 16 bstr-odd-37. Then SELECT ID, FSingle FROM W ORDER BY ID read once. Asks, per source tag, whether Put and Update succeed or raise, and which tag and value ACE returns.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
